t:120px;--scroll-delay:0ms;--scroll-duration:1000ms\"><div class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-container listParrafsWithImg-item-container0\"><article class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item \"><div class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-text listParrafsWithImg-item-text-oneParraf\"><p class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-text-subTitle\">Escapada corta</p><h2 class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-text-title\">2 días</h2><div class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-text-divider\"></div><div class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-text-article listParrafsWithImg-item-text-article-oneParraf\">Conoce la cultura nativa de Lamas y relájate en la Laguna Azul con paseo en bote y a caballo. Recojo del hotel, guía y almuerzo incluidos. Desde S/ 145 por persona.</div><a class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-text-button buttonPrimary\" href=\"/tours/tarapoto-2dias\">Ver Más</a></div><div class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-images listParrafsWithImg-item-images-oneParraf\"><img class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-images-img listParrafsWithImg-item-images-img-oneParraf\" src=\"/img/imagenesPromociones/2dias/listaPromocion.jpg\" alt=\"2 días\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></article></div></div><div class=\"scrollAnimation scrollAnimation-right \" style=\"--animation-displacement:120px;--scroll-delay:0ms;--scroll-duration:1000ms\"><div class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-container listParrafsWithImg-item-container1\"><article class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item listParrafsWithImg-item-reversed\"><div class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-text listParrafsWithImg-item-text-oneParraf\"><p class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-text-subTitle\">Cultura, lagunas y cascadas</p><h2 class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-text-title\">3 días</h2><div class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-text-divider\"></div><div class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-text-article listParrafsWithImg-item-text-article-oneParraf\">Suma a tu viaje las cataratas de Ahuashiyacu y recorre Lamas, la Laguna Azul y la naturaleza de la Cordillera Escalera con guía y movilidad incluidos. Desde S/ 195 por persona.</div><a class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-text-button buttonPrimary\" href=\"/tours/tarapoto-3dias\">Ver Más</a></div><div class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-images listParrafsWithImg-item-images-oneParraf\"><img class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-images-img listParrafsWithImg-item-images-img-oneParraf\" src=\"/img/imagenesPromociones/3dias/listaPromocion.jpg\" alt=\"3 días\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></article></div></div><div class=\"scrollAnimation scrollAnimation-right \" style=\"--animation-displacement:120px;--scroll-delay:0ms;--scroll-duration:1000ms\"><div class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-container listParrafsWithImg-item-container0\"><article class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item \"><div class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-text listParrafsWithImg-item-text-oneParraf\"><p class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-text-subTitle\">La experiencia completa</p><h2 class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-text-title\">4 días</h2><div class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-text-divider\"></div><div class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-text-article listParrafsWithImg-item-text-article-oneParraf\">Vive todo Tarapoto: Lamas, Laguna Azul, Moyobamba con sus aguas termales y café de altura, y las cataratas de Ahuashiyacu. El recorrido más completo, desde S/ 294 por persona.</div><a class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-text-button buttonPrimary\" href=\"/tours/tarapoto-4dias\">Ver Más</a></div><div class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-images listParrafsWithImg-item-images-oneParraf\"><img class=\"listParrafsWithImg-item-images-img listParrafsWithImg-item-images-img-oneParraf\" src=\"/img/imagenesPromociones/4dias/listaPromocion.jpg\" alt=\"4 días\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></article></div></div></section></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><aside class=\"floatingWhatsapp \"><a href=\"https://wa.me/+51929183224?text=Hola%2C%20me%20encuentro%20interesado%20reservar%20un%20paquete%20con%20ustedes.\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"floatingWhatsapp\" aria-label=\"WhatsApp\" title=\"Contáctanos por WhatsApp\"><i class=\"fa fa-brand